cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite this software and the accompanying manuscript."
type: software
version: 1.0.0
title: "Beyond peak dose: the 72-hour transition after vasopressor withdrawal in septic shock"
abstract: "Analysis code and disclosure-protected aggregate results for a three-cohort clinical study of vasopressor withdrawal using MIMIC-IV, SICdb and AmsterdamUMCdb. Patient-level data, fitted models and imputation objects are not included. Code is licensed under MIT; released aggregate results and repository figure derivatives are licensed under CC BY 4.0. Portable input-generation routes are provided but have not been tested end to end with source data."
